OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Corridors_B1F_Text_MossIntro::
	.string "Lamp's out. Mind your step --\n"
	.string "the deck plates are lifted.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Corridors_B1F_Text_MossDefeat::
	.string "Watch the plates, I said.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Corridors_B1F_Text_MossPostBattle::
	.string "Below is all store rooms. The\n"
	.string "aft one's the CAPTAIN's, and\l"
	.string "he keeps it locked from inside.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Corridors_B1F_Text_Maeve::
	.string "Don't trouble the CAPTAIN. He's\n"
	.string "aft, behind the store room\l"
	.string "door, and he doesn't receive.\p"
	.string "He'll receive you. They all say\n"
	.string "that, and he always does.$"
